  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "0.5 cup warm milk",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter, softened",
    "1 large egg",
    "3.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place water, milk, 1/3 cup butter, egg, flour, sugar, salt, and yeast into the pan of a bread machine in the order listed, or follow the order recommended by your manufacturer if different. Select Dough/Knead and First Rise Cycle; press start.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k8ftXPiEHDYe91XBEC6Rs5LPuQE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17690-sweet-dinner-rolls-ddmfs-step1-0692-3f32254aae024b29b25c9eea55ecae65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17690/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the cycle finishes, turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface. Divide dough in half. Roll each half into a 12-inch circle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mV2jQomwmzq19Kzp2fllKHUjSNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17690-sweet-dinner-rolls-ddmfs-step4-0762-8664262333ac4919b2e27672933f4022.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17690/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread 1/4 cup softened butter over entire round. Cut each circle into 8 wedges. Roll wedges starting at the wide end; roll gently but tightly. Place point side down on ungreased cookie sheet. Cover with a clean kitchen towel and put in a warm place to let rise for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IYS_QTTS5Y4CURDmaGADWL4deC0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17690-sweet-dinner-rolls-ddmfs-step4-0774-7f913111ebb4484f850d5daf06565efd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17690/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake rolls in the preheated oven until golden, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kuv51VOm7_XcAQ9t3Czdx1aeNR8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17690-sweet-dinner-rolls-ddmfs-3X2-0794-ec841a045f96458fb6b690b3617f65c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17690/step_05.webp"
    }
